# Two secrets the hardened build needs. The Deploy to Cloudflare page asks for both.
# RILL_DATA_KEY encrypts saved add-on keys: 32 random bytes in base64. Run `openssl rand -base64 32`.
# Keep a copy somewhere safe; if it changes, saved add-on keys can't be read anymore.
RILL_DATA_KEY=
# RILL_SETUP_TOKEN is a one-time code that proves you own a new install. Run `openssl rand -hex 16`.
RILL_SETUP_TOKEN=
# Optional. Rill generates its own signing key when this is absent.
# RILL_SECRET=
# TMDB_KEY=
